          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau agirira Yakobo urwanko, kubg’ umuhezagiro se yamuhezagiye: maze Esau arivuganya mu mutima, ati Data ashigaje igihe gito tukaja ku kigandaro: ni ho nzokwica murumunanje Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babarira Rebeka amagambo ya Esau imfura yiwe; ahamagaza Yakobo ari we Butoyi, aramubgira, at’ Umve, Esau mukurwawe agira yimare ishavu wamuteye, akwice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero mwana wanje, umve nkubarire: kūra hasi, uhunge, uje i Harani kwa Labani musazanje, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ube uramazey’ imisi mikeya, gushitsa ah’ ishavu rya mukurwawe rizoshirira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akazika agufitiye kagashira kuri wewe, akibagira ivyo wamukoreye: maze nzoca ngutumako, ugaruke: none nobaburira rimwe mwempi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
